window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Oops, I just summoned my grumpy demon boss!</b></p> <p>In my defense, I needed revenge on my cheating ex after he announced his engagement to the woman he left me for. And yeah, I might have been drunk.</p> <p>When Azeroth shows up in my kitchen, my half-baked plan for revenge feels like an afterthought in the face of his dark, dangerous eyes and his chiseled body—who knew he was hiding abs of steel under his business suit? But a summoning is a summoning, and now he's stuck by my side until I'm satisfied.</p> <p>Fake dating my billionaire demon boss sounds like the perfect revenge right about now. What better way to show I'm so moved on already?</p> <p>Only, the more I get to know the real Azeroth, the more I see a guy who really deserves my love. Our relationship might be fake, but surely there's no faking the heat that ignites between us every time we touch.</p> <p>My grann told me never trust a demon, but I think I'm falling. I just hope I don't get my heart broken again.</p>"; 
